        <details><summary>What is Mechanic Connect and how does it work?</summary><div class="ans"><p>A Jamaican-built digital platform connecting vehicle owners with verified garages and independent mechanics. Customers download the app, create an account, describe their issue, upload photos if needed, and either receive quotes or book directly from available service providers.</p></div></details>
