        <details><summary>What happens after the inspection?</summary><div class="ans"><p>OH-PEL provides the findings and, where work is needed, recommendations and a quotation. You are under no obligation to proceed. If you want the work done, you can book it through Mechanic Connect.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>Is a diagnostic scan included?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Diagnostic scanning may be a separate service depending on what your vehicle needs. Message us and the team can confirm whether it applies in your case.</p></div></details>
