        <details><summary>Why do I need an account, and who can use the app?</summary><div class="ans"><p>An account lets you save vehicle details, track service history, manage payments and communicate securely with mechanics. Users must be 18 years or older.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>How does payment work? Is my money safe?</summary><div class="ans"><p>All payments are made inside the app and held securely. Funds are released to the mechanic only after you confirm the job is completed.</p></div></details>
