        <details><summary>How and when do I get paid, and how does commission work?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Once the customer marks the job complete, funds are released to your Mechanic Connect wallet after commission is applied. Commission is 15% on completed jobs, with a minimum of J$500 and a maximum of J$25,000, subject to the applicable platform terms.</p><p>Early Partner Garages — the first 50 — receive a discounted rate for their first 60 days, after which accounts move automatically to the standard structure.</p><p>Standard payouts to your Jamaican bank account are processed twice per week, every Wednesday and Friday. If you need funds sooner, you may request a next-business-day payout, which attracts an early withdrawal processing fee.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>Why does the commission percentage change by job size?</summary><div class="ans"><p>To keep the platform fair for both small and large jobs. Small jobs require a minimum fee to cover platform costs, while large jobs benefit from a lower effective percentage and a maximum cap, so garages are never overcharged on big invoices.</p></div></details>
